Dataset contents retain their source notices and licensing status.

circuits/a64.json.gz and circuits/stmp157.json.gz are routing abstractions of
OLIMEX Ltd. OLINUXINO designs licensed CC-BY-SA-3.0-US.
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/us/

circuits/orangecrab.json.gz is a routing abstraction of Gregory Davill's OrangeCrab
hardware, licensed CERN-OHL-1.2. The unmodified upstream license and notice are
included in licenses/.

The pinned H3 and A13 source repositories contain no explicit license file.
Their status is recorded as NOASSERTION in the corresponding provenance files;
this repository does not assign them a different license.

Source URLs, source revisions, hashes, attribution, and extraction changes are
recorded in provenance/. The same source terms apply to derived preview images
and reduced reproduction data. No blanket license is asserted over the bundle.

The H616, ButterStick, Glider, i.MX6 and iCE/Pi fixtures are routing abstractions
of the pinned public boards named in manifest.json and provenance/new-boards.json.
This repository does not relicense those source designs. Refer to each immutable
source repository for its design notices and terms.
